WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
Start in an ordinary vault. Board keeps project tasks beside your notes.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.710
Open Settings.

3
00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:10.140
Choose Features.

4
00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.800
Enable Agents to reveal Projects, Board and Manager.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:17.210
Close Settings. Local Boards do not require a T3 connection.

6
00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:20.840
Open the app menu.

7
00:00:20.840 --> 00:00:25.120
Choose New Folder.

8
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.220
Name the folder Garden plans.

9
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:32.660
Create the folder.

10
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:36.430
Right-click the folder.

11
00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.940
Choose Make this a project.

12
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.350
Keep local defaults, then Create project.

13
00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.810
Open the Projects picker.

14
00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:50.610
Select Garden plans.

15
00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:54.580
Choose Create board.

16
00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:57.920
Keep the title. Goal, Repository and Stage note are optional.

17
00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.530
Save with Create board.

18
00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:04.970
Open Local cards.

19
00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.430
Choose Add card.

20
00:01:08.430 --> 00:01:12.810
Enter a title. Todo is the default state.

21
00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:16.210
Choose Save card.

22
00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:19.690
Edit the saved card.

23
00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:23.210
Choose Doing.

24
00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:26.690
Choose Save card to persist the new state.

25
00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:30.140
Return to Manage board.

26
00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:35.790
Close Manage board. The card is now in In progress.

27
00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:41.230
Switch to Board for the same saved tasks.

28
00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:44.867
Return to List.
